{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUG FILTER OPTION (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

One tick box of a filter group in the rug list.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* facet: the key of the group (collection, level, material, pile or colour)
* value: the value this box stands for, as stored in the rug data
* label: the text shown
* group: the title of the group, used in the chips of active filters
* swatch: an optional colour (or "multi") shown as a dot before the label
* section_id: the ID of the rug list section

"RUGCTX" in the ID is replaced by the section with "sidebar" or "drawer", because the groups are printed twice.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- capture id -%}rug-RUGCTX-{{ section_id }}-{{ facet }}-{{ value | handleize }}{%- endcapture -%}

<div class="checkbox-control rug-filter__option">
  <input type="checkbox" class="checkbox" id="{{ id }}" value="{{ value | escape }}" data-rug-list="{{ section_id }}" data-facet="{{ facet }}" data-label="{{ label | escape }}" data-group="{{ group | escape }}">

  <label for="{{ id }}">
    {%- if swatch == 'multi' -%}
      <span class="rug-filter__swatch rug-filter__swatch--multi"></span>
    {%- elsif swatch != blank -%}
      <span class="rug-filter__swatch" style="--swatch: {{ swatch }}"></span>
    {%- endif -%}

    <span>{{ label | escape }}</span>
    <span class="rug-filter__count" data-rug-option-count></span>
  </label>
</div>
